      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FROM A DISTANCE (1) is a promising type who notched his 20th career success when too good (25.48) at Q Lakeside last time. Has a strong record here at this journey including three wins. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from five starts. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. DAINTREE TOMMY (2) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 5th (19.40) at this track. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Has ability and can atone. BRUNSWICK ROCKET (4) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind PASS ME NOT (19.48) in a Mix 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to be in this for a long way. FINNIS BALE (7) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish at a big quote.",
